{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54936","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 四十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯劳鸟，啼叫在军营。\n南北敌人困我将，东西只是有虚声，此象甚分明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}